{title: Yeh Junoon}
{artist: Mustafa Zahid}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] Mehsoos khud ko tere [B] bina,        Maine [A] kabhi kiya [E] nahi
[E] Tu kya jane lamha [B] koi,        Maine [A] kabhi jiya [E] nahi
[E] Ab jo mile hain to,        [G#m] Shikwe gile na ho
[A] Bas ishq ho,        Bas ishq [E] ho
[E] Ab jo hase hain to,        [G#m] Ansu koi na ho
[A] Bas ishq ho,        Bas ishq [B] ho
Yeh [E] junoon mera,        [G#m] Mujhe le jaye [A] kahan [B] kahan
Rab [E] tujh mein,        Ab paa [G#m] raha hoon main
[A] yahaan [B] yahaan,        Ab [E] jee loon teri
[G#m] Ankhon me ye [A] jahaan [B] jahan,        Tu [E] gaya to roya tha
[G#m] Sang mere [A] aasman [B] aasmaan,        [E] [C#m] [B] [A]
[C#m] [F#m] [A] [E],        [E] Yaadon mein raha
Tujhse [F#m] ho kar main juda,        [A] Ab tanha mujhe na [E] chodna
[E] Khwaabo ne kaha,        Chehre [F#m] se ab ye mere
[A] Ye nazaarein kabhi na [E] modna,        Ab jo [B] mile hain to
