[E] Phir se kareeb aa,        [G#m] Mere naseeb aa
[A] Hai ye dua hai ye [E] dua,        [E] Dil ne mere kaha
[G#m] Tera rahoon sadaa,        [A] Hai ye dua hai ye [B] dua
Yeh [E] junoon mera,        [G#m] Mujhe le jaye [A] kahaan [B] kahaan
